{"data": [{"author_id": "1771201371431219201", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:44:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119939242206093396"], "id": "2119939242206093396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 402, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119618095384031734", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"If Elon Musk had stopped working and Tesla were his only remaining venture, several major technological and industrial developments—along with their real-world impacts—would not exist in the form they do today:\n\nWhat Would Not Have Happened (Other Companies &amp; Projects)\n\nSpaceX &amp; https://t.co/hGISD60D9B", "url": "https://x.com/SpringerRC24720/status/2119939242206093396"}, {"author_id": "565774659", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:56:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119972546062029067"], "id": "2119972546062029067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 4453, "like_count": 252, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 99}, "text": "Elon Musk's Neuralink has demonstrated how its brain-computer interface can help a man living with ALS communicate using his thoughts. The participant, identified as Terry, used the experimental implant to tell his wife “I love you” through a synthetic version of his own voice. https://t.co/TAbJ8YH4Zx", "url": "https://x.com/nettermike/status/2119972546062029067"}, {"author_id": "1833906499846025216", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:46:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119939775138607464"], "id": "2119939775138607464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 489, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不懂就问，\n\n老马的脑机接口什么时候能推广啊？\n\n我想拿它用意念刷 x 打字发帖回复，\n\n现在不止手指，连语音都累了！\n@grok \n😭😭😭", "url": "https://x.com/want_take_easy/status/2119939775138607464"}, {"author_id": "1546701118771986432", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:34:00.000Z", "edit_history_tw